<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Website Saya</title>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            background: #f4f4f4;
            text-align: center;
        }

        header {
            background: #24292e;
            color: white;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .container {
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            background: #0366d6;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            background: #024ea2;
        }

        footer {
            margin-top: 40px;
            padding: 15px;
            background: #24292e;
            color: white;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1>Selamat Datang</h1>
        <p>Website yang dihosting dengan GitHub Pages</p>
    </header>

    <div class="container">
        <h2>Halo Dunia!</h2>
        <p>Ini adalah website HTML sederhana.</p>
        <a href="https://github.com" class="btn">Kunjungi GitHub</a>
    </div>

    <footer>
        © 2026 Website Saya
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
